<PageTitle>About OCAD Versioner</PageTitle>

<h1>OCAD Versioner</h1>

<p>
    Version control for orienteering maps in OCAD format. Pick a project folder,
    snapshot the map as a version, and compare versions side by side.
</p>

<h2 class="h5 mt-4">How the map is drawn</h2>
<p>
    Maps are parsed and rendered by Purple Pen's map engine, compiled to
    WebAssembly and running entirely in your browser. Nothing is uploaded: the
    files stay on your machine and there is no server.
</p>

